Description: Rockchip RK3566 support
 The build lists, configuration and hooks for the RK3566 platform, whose
 drivers are in xnu-overlay/. The interrupt controller hooks call a common
 GIC interface with a GICv2 and a GICv3 implementation.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
